007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.16.1.7 and its proof, printed pp.485–486 / PDF pp.505–506"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CETrace}\">\\(\\mathrm{CETrace}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ea6b8d0468b95296\" href=\"?note=ea6b8d0468b95296\" title=\"43-df-ce-trace\">43-df-ce-trace</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\iff\\exists h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{Order}(h)\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\,(\\mathrm{Computable}^A(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\,\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,f,h))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\iff\\exists h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{Order}(h)\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\,(\\mathrm{Computable}^A(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\,\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,f,h))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此概念只要求迹的总关系可枚举，比可计算强数组迹弱。原 lowforschnorr-char 把这两者混淆，本次纠正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7144eefd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-order-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce-trace","status":"resolved","id":"ea6b8d0468b95296","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7144eefd8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]，$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce-trace","status":"resolved","id":"ea6b8d0468b95296","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]，$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]，$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Order}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CETrace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\iff\\exists h\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{Order}(h)\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\,(\\mathrm{Computable}^A(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\,\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,f,h))].","display":true}],"bytes":1324,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-340","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-traceable]] — 可枚举可迹性"},{"id":"47e0fc3d4fc32c3c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。"},{"id":"bd1df970cb50d0b4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CETraceable}$、$\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A$、$\\mathrm{MLTest}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-schnorrtest]]、[[43-df-mltest]]；$U,V$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","9919dea7144eefd8","ea6b8d0468b95296","4400f4836786a4bd"]}